WEBVTT

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.620
I heard from Haruko-<i>senpai!</i>

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:14.220
You're doing training?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.090
They say that strength comes from continuation!

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:19.760
Please allow me to help, too!

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.590
Well, let's go at it with energy!

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:28.100
Let's do narrow stance push-ups today.

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:34.610
Putting your fingers close together in a triangle, like this,

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:37.540
will allow you to do push-ups with a narrow stance.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:47.190
It may be more difficult than normal push-ups so reduce the repetitions.

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:51.390
So three sets of five to ten push-ups are enough!

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.430
Now, let's begin!

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.830
One-two! One-two!

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:03.170
If you want strong arms, do it a maximum of five to six repetitions.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:08.410
If you want narrow arms, aim for around thirty repetitions.

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:10.310
That's the rule to follow!

00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:17.780
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.520
One-two! One-two!

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:27.760
It's good to talk to the muscles you're strengthening while training.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:31.790
For these push-ups that would be your outer arms and your chest.

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:37.370
Try your best triceps brachii!

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:41.230
Hang in there, pectoralis major!

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:48.280
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:52.180
One-two! One-t...

00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:56.280
U-Um, your face is too close to my chest!

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:06.770
Um. Next are sit-ups, but please don't look too closely.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:08.230
Okay?

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:13.240
The hip raises we're about to do will strengthen your stomach

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:16.780
as well as the surrounding muscles!

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:21.450
But please don't force yourself when your back hurts

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.550
or when it's painful to do ten repetitions.

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.280
It's a promise!

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.660
One-two! One-two!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:34.190
Do this in three sets of ten to thirty repetitions, as well!

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:38.490
When it hurts to do more than ten, please switch to normal sit ups!

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:41.570
Here we go!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:47.610
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.510
One-two! One-two!

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:55.780
The muscle that has to work hard is obviously your abs!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:58.920
Please talk to them properly!

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.420
It's fine to bend your knees a little,

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:04.720
but always keep your thighs perpendicular!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:09.190
Huh?

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:12.860
Why are we training near the poolside?

00:03:12.860 --> 00:03:14.770
That's obvious!

00:03:14.770 --> 00:03:17.940
So we can jump in after working up a sweat!

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:23.940
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:29.920
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:03:29.920 --> 00:03:34.490
One-two! One-two!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:36.980
All right! That's enough for today!

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:39.990
It's dangerous if you stand there!

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:44.520
I'm sorry!

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:53.410
I didn't think you would be there!

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.970
L-Let's do some safe training next!

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.470
This next training exercise also uses many different muscles.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:07.750
Please don't ignore the muscles and talk to all of them properly.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:12.790
If you have confidence in your neck muscles

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.260
you can use your hands only for support.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.400
Please pay attention to the abdominal and back muscles, too!

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:26.870
If you can do a beautiful bridge, it means your muscles are well balanced!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.930
Work hard on your training until you can do it beautifully!

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:37.820
The burden on your neck muscles changes depending on your arm support.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:41.290
So support yourself with your arms if you lack confidence in your neck.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:42.720
Let's begin!

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:49.560
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:55.570
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:59.670
One-two! One-two!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:03.010
This is starting to make me hungry.

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:05.440
But I have to be held back!

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:08.910
Sweets after exercise taste extra special!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:13.550
Let's eat some snacks together after we finish.

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:19.560
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:25.530
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.590
One-two!

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:32.900
You don't have to hit a certain number, so do them carefully!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.700
Doing three sets of a few repetitions each is plenty!

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:44.980
You can pause during the bridge pose or lift your heels for more results!

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:50.960
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:56.790
One-two! One-two! One-t...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.660
D-D-Don't bring your face in that close!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:07.570
You're examining me too much...

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:13.550
I guess a bikini is showing too much.

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:15.810
I'll go change.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:20.480
This won't distract you.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:23.680
Let's start fresh with squats!

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.890
I'm sure you learned this from Haruko-<i>senpai,</i>

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:33.760
but be careful with your back and your posture to protect your hips.

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:41.830
These squats are a little hard, so three sets of ten to fifteen reps is good.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:48.040
This training is for quadriceps and inner thighs!

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:52.180
Be sure to cheer them on properly!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:58.190
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:04.200
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:10.640
One-two! If you hunch your back, it'll burden your hips.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:13.170
So please make sure to keep your back straight!

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:19.040
Y-You're wrong! I'm not crossing my arms to hide my chest!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:22.150
Understand? I'm going to continue!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:28.150
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:34.160
One-two! One-two! One-two!

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:39.150
One-two! One-two! Huh?

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:42.990
Please don't look!

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:47.640
We'll end with flexibility.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:51.210
We'll focus on the joints today.

00:07:51.210 --> 00:08:06.490
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:09.560
Now, we'll open!

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:24.100
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten.

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:27.680
Please do it so it doesn't hurt.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:31.180
Then, one more time!

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:33.810
Close, open, close.

00:08:34.920 --> 00:08:36.660
How was it?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.290
It may have been a bit difficult,

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.590
but if you continue you'll definitely get results!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:47.260
Please train with me again!

00:08:53.310 --> 00:08:57.110
I'm glad I didn't go overboard and wear this.

00:08:58.610 --> 00:09:02.280
I borrowed this from Aki-<i>sensei,</i> but if I wore something like this,

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.840
we wouldn't have been able to do any training at all.

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:10.280
But I'll definitely become a woman who fits in this swimsuit someday!
